A BARE VALUE BINDS A PHANTOM PARAMETER, and this line stands to show it. TiddlyWiki reads
`https` as a parameter name and the positional slot receives nothing — the reason every sigil
value in this house takes quotes. The form below carries the hazard on purpose.

<<~ aka https://example.com/reference>>

<<~ aka "https://example.com/reference">>

<<~ ahu #a-section>>

A body inside the section.

<<~ /ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>


<<~ lares aim from="lar://alias:grant@host/a.b.c" -> to="lar://alias:grant@host/d.e.f">>

<<~! a pragma sigil>>

<<~?>>

<<~ hoike lar:///a.b.c -> ?>>

!! The HUD, in the form the boot seed writes it

<<~ lares aim from="lar://mara:operator@crossroads/operator.weighs.deps" -> to="lar://compita:agent@crossroads/council.options.cuts">>
<<~ set hud="aim" mode="draft" mu="_!" stance="🏛️🗡️" focus="16/arc" feedback="9/declare-glyphs" drift-ward="a preferred answer already stands and the comparison bends toward it">>
<<~ oracle "↯11 ✲ ⚃(4) ⁂:⬡🌖◈⟁">>
<<~ set hud="yield" drift-ward="the read rides on a README and no changelog · ↻ L-Prime" focus="10/measure -> 12/measure" feedback="closed 0↺ -> open 1φ @◇:fork.depends-on.maintenance-weight">>
<<~ lares yield from="lar://compita:agent@crossroads/council.fork.named/awaiting-weight" -> to="?">>

!! The gauges, standing alone mid-stream

<<~ focus "9/measure">>
<<~ stance "poet humorist">>
<<~ mu "*?">>
<<~ drift-ward "the pull this exchange carries">>

!! The rows, each a name and its parameters

<<~ mu Wand "ascii/* glyph/🜂 element/Fire feed/Visual pull/ignition">>
<<~ carry Detail "ascii/* ascii/!">>
<<~ season Chaos "glyph/✶ patron/Hung-Mung">>
<<~ persona Map-Wisp "role/Scryer trigger/pattern-or-risk moves/map-structure-project-implication ~ diagrams the consequence path">>
<<~ integrity LitWard "tell/Mana-Drift recover/re-light-L-Prime ~ map never fuses to territory">>
<<~ shrine Household "gaia/home-niches-family-tended elyncia/single-orichalcum-figure ~ fed by one family or crew">>
<<~ frame lares "move/intent-vector carries/bearing-vector fires/aim fires/yield ~ aim delegates at open">>
<<~ loops "✶ observe -> ⏿ orient -> ◇ decide -> ▶ act -> ↺ hoʻoko/aftermath">>
<<~ config Defaults>>
<<~ node "-> refreshes the libation dish, the shrine incense burns">>
